Reused components: Chrome DOM/CDP execution, page observation, script validation,
tool parameter descriptions, and bundled site notes. The DSH plugin runtime,
local connection manager, native tool adapter and settings UI are new.
There is no MCP server or MCP client in Tiehua's execution path.
